# Copy to Gradex_AI_Client/.env.local (it is git-ignored). Never commit real values.

# Gradex AI Server address, with no trailing slash. The viva pages (Workspace, Assessment,
# Live Viva, Results) and the grading pages all call this host.
#
# Local development: leave it empty. The Vite dev server then calls the same origin and forwards
# /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts), so just start the server on port 8000.
# Deployed or a different port: set the full server URL, for example
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://api.your-domain.example
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8001
# The server must list the client's own address in CORS_ORIGINS (Gradex_AI_Server/app/.env).
VITE_BACKEND_URL=

# Older name for the same setting; only used when VITE_BACKEND_URL is empty.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
